    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c1_body",
      "x": 81,
      "y": 159,
      "width": 281,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "The journey begins deep within the\nlegacy repository before a single line\nof code is touched. By analyzing years\nof version control commits, structural\nchurn, and tacit developer conventions,\nwe uncover the hidden domain boundaries\nand unspoken co-change couplings that\nformal documentation forgot.",
      "originalText": "The journey begins deep within the\nlegacy repository before a single line\nof code is touched. By analyzing years\nof version control commits, structural\nchurn, and tacit developer conventions,\nwe uncover the hidden domain boundaries\nand unspoken co-change couplings that\nformal documentation forgot.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 10
