    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c2_body",
      "x": 81,
      "y": 349,
      "width": 274,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "With the historical territory charted,\nwe step into the living anatomy of the\ncodebase. We extract comprehensive\nabstract syntax trees and recover\ndynamic runtime invariants\u2014identifying\npointer lifetimes, memory layouts, and\nidiom targets\u2014to determine the optimal\nglobal migration path.",
      "originalText": "With the historical territory charted,\nwe step into the living anatomy of the\ncodebase. We extract comprehensive\nabstract syntax trees and recover\ndynamic runtime invariants\u2014identifying\npointer lifetimes, memory layouts, and\nidiom targets\u2014to determine the optimal\nglobal migration path.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 10
    },
