    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c3_body",
      "x": 81,
      "y": 674,
      "width": 288,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Next, the architectural blueprint is\ndrawn. We decompose the monolithic\nsource into atomic, context-sized syntax\nfragments, untangle circular import\ncycles through reverse-topological\nscheduling, and scaffold compilable\ntarget skeletons so every incoming\nfunction has an immediate anchor.",
