    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c4_body",
      "x": 81,
      "y": 839,
      "width": 288,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "Here, the active metamorphosis takes\nflight. We translate each fragment in\nscheduled order, threading a continuous\nrolling context of previously translated\ntypes and querying language servers on\ndemand to ensure every new construct\nremains idiomatic and globally coherent.",
