    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c5_body",
      "x": 1896,
      "y": 159,
      "width": 288,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Before the transformed code ever reaches\na compiler, it enters rigorous\nadversarial inspection. Adopting a\nstrict auditor persona, we aggressively\nhunt for hallucinated APIs, phantom type\nsignatures, and subtle syntax drifts,\nintercepting flaws before expensive\ntoolchains are engaged.",
      "originalText": "Before the transformed code ever reaches\na compiler, it enters rigorous\nadversarial inspection. Adopting a\nstrict auditor persona, we aggressively\nhunt for hallucinated APIs, phantom type\nsignatures, and subtle syntax drifts,\nintercepting flaws before expensive\ntoolchains are engaged.",
