      "type": "text",
      "id": "c6_body",
      "x": 1896,
      "y": 309,
      "width": 288,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Now the code confronts mechanical ground\ntruth. We execute target compilers and\ntest runners through a strict cascaded\nharness, validating build integrity,\nsynthesizing missing regression tests,\nand enforcing an invariant guard that\nrejects any silently weakened\nassertions.",
