      "x": 1896,
      "y": 694,
      "width": 281,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Clean compilation is not the finish\nline; true migration demands behavioral\nfidelity. An ensemble of independent\njudge agents cross-examines execution\ntraces and runtime edge cases against\nthe original source, ensuring exact\nsemantic equivalence across all\noperating conditions.",
